-- words --
A runner in clone B runs a line before the select in clone A, then the owner lands the Goal in A, then A merges B's log: status in A lists B's run under refused at replay, and the landed Goal keeps the rows the owner saw.
-- run --
hyp status "$G"
-- floor: contains --
G  ended
-- floor: contains --
landed: by owner
-- floor: contains --
refused at replay
-- ceiling --
G  landed
